'Quantum Computing Jobs Surge in 2026: Postings Already Pass All of 2025, Coresignal Data Shows',
'',
'Quantum computing job postings reached 4,518 from January through August 2026, Coresignal reported on 27 October 2026, already nearly 58% above the 2,861 postings recorded for all of 2025. Google leads hiring at 6.4% of ads, with most postings in the United States. The report states no salary range and no single closing date.',
